    {
      "id": "M4165-A",
      "skill": "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill",
      "language": "zh+en",
      "prompt": "A. 以下为给定运算，不代表实际实验：甲用类别系数乘分类交叉熵；乙在训练期间根据无标签目标测量的伪类别计数生成标量w，把目标特征f变成w*f后才送入非线性映射phi，再比较源/目标映射均值。乙的分类交叉熵没有该类系数，预测时只保留编码器与分类器。请解释两者能否因都叫class-weighted就使用同一完整机制名；并按当前库中P44、P96、P97及如有P98的实际记录，报告分类损失class-weighting/weighted-CE双来源准入是否已完成，区分不存在记录与数学操作不合法。不要从题设给定运算推断新文献已被实际读过。\n另核对：phi(v)=v^2、f=2、w=3时，phi(w*f)和w*phi(f)是否相同？一个四样本集合f=[1,2,2,2]、w=[2,2/3,2/3,2/3]具有平均系数1；计算原特征均值、缩放后均值、平均phi(w*f)及平均w*phi(f)，判断平均系数归一化是否足以保证特征统计或核几何不变。保持线性映射等有条件等价，不要求作者机械更换公式；来源全名与实现歧义仍须按来源保留。",
      "required_behaviors": [
        "Distinguish classification-loss factors from features weighted before a mapping/discriminator, retaining conditional homogeneity equivalence and the exact supplied means.",
        "Use actual current source records without treating P98 as a second classification-loss definition, inferring a source kernel or promoting full names/Chinese compounds."
      ],
      "forbidden_behaviors": [
        "Treat mean coefficient one as preservation of feature statistics or geometry, or require moving a coefficient regardless of its mapping.",
        "Claim an incomplete admission record invalidates mathematical weighting or invent paper reading."
      ],
      "tested_skills": [
        "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill"
      ],
      "outcome": "pass",
      "reason": "Preserves exact placement/normalization counterexamples and valid homogeneity cases, reads P98 as a contrasting feature interface rather than a completed class-loss pair, and does not invent a source kernel or full-name admission.",
      "evaluator": "Maintainer semantic review; no independent second grader",
